## Ported third-party code

`sim/src/libm/exp.ts` is a transcription of `__ieee754_exp` from **fdlibm**, Sun
Microsystems' freely distributable libm, whose licence asks only that its notice travel
with it:

> Copyright (C) 1993 by Sun Microsystems, Inc. All rights reserved.
>
> Developed at SunPro, a Sun Microsystems, Inc. business.
> Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software is freely granted,
> provided that this notice is preserved.

It is carried because the simulation takes no transcendental function from the JavaScript
runtime: neither engine reproduces numpy's `exp`, and the engines do not reproduce each
other's.

`sim/src/rng/mt19937.ts` and `sim/src/rng/random.ts` are hand transcriptions of CPython's
`Modules/_randommodule.c` and `Lib/random.py`, written with those sources open — the same
posture as the simulation port above, and no clean-room claim is made. CPython is under the
**Python Software Foundation License 2.0**, which permits derivative works provided its
copyright notice is retained:

> Copyright (C) 2001-2026 Python Software Foundation. All rights reserved.

The Mersenne Twister those files implement is by Takuji Nishimura and Makoto Matsumoto
(1997-2002), BSD-3-Clause, and its notice travels inside CPython's own file.

## Adding an asset with different terms

The bulk statements above are the rule. An asset whose terms differ from the block that
would otherwise cover it gets a sidecar `<asset>.license` beside it naming the source,
the licence and any attribution the licence requires — and the bulk statement stays
untouched. Sidecars exist only for exceptions.

## Source offer

Serving the built bundle distributes object code, and GPL-2.0 §3 answers that with the
corresponding source. The corresponding source is **this repository at the commit the bundle
was built from**. The licences page in the game is generated from this file at build time and
stamped with that commit, and it names the address the repository is published at. It is
reachable from the start screen, so whoever receives the bundle can find it without ending a
game.
